      "body": "Over the last 90 days, the stock has risen 14% to ₹469. The fair value is estimated to be ₹389, however this is not to be taken as a sell recommendation but rather should be used as a guide only. Revenue has been flat over the last 3 years. Earnings per share has grown by 4.9%. For the next 3 years, revenue is forecast to grow by 7.8% per annum. Earnings are also forecast to grow by 12% per annum over the same time period.",
